#: ../index.rst-1
msgid ""
"Fanaka is a handbook for African success in the international software "
"industry"
msgstr "Fanaka est un manuel pour la réussite africaine dans l'industrie internationale du logiciel"

#: ../index.rst:7
msgid "Fanaka"
msgstr "Fanaka"

#: ../index.rst:11
msgid ""
"Fanaka is a handbook for prospective and early-career African professionals "
"in the international software industry."
msgstr ""
"Fanaka est un guide pour les Africains au début de leur carrière "
"professionelle dans l'industrie technologique à l'internationale."

#: ../index.rst:12
msgid ""
"It aims to cover some of the gaps they face, and help people work across "
"them to success, in finding work, and at work."
msgstr ""

#: ../index.rst:16
msgid ""
"*Fanaka* means *success* in Kiswahili, one of the most-widely spoken "
"languages in Africa."
msgstr ""
"*Fanaka* signifie *succès* en kiswahili, l'une des langues les plus parlées "
"en Afrique."

#: ../index.rst:18
msgid ""
"It's based on years of experience: of African professionals who have "
"successfully navigated the challenges, and also of the colleagues who have "
"worked with them and can offer insight and advice from the other side of the"
" table."
msgstr ""

#: ../index.rst:22
msgid "Opportunities"
msgstr "Opportunités"

#: ../index.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Africans are well-placed for opportunities in the global software "
"industry.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../index.rst:28
msgid "Contribute your perspective"
msgstr "Apportez votre point de vue"

#: ../index.rst:30
msgid ":ref:`How to contribute <contribute>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Comment contribuer <contribute>`"

#: ../index.rst:32
msgid ""
"Africans typically speak English and other European languages to a high "
"standard. They are served by many good universities. Reliable and reasonably"
" fast Internet connections are available in most African cities. African "
"time zones are ideal for remote workers in European organisations."
msgstr ""

#: ../index.rst:37
msgid "Challenges"
msgstr "Défis"

#: ../index.rst:39
msgid "At the same time, Africans also face some challenges."
msgstr ""

#: ../index.rst:41
msgid ""
"Relatively, their numbers in the industry are very low. That means it's "
"harder for them to understand some of its expectations, and also for "
"companies in the industry to understand the particular cultural contexts of "
"African candidates. Similar gaps in familiarity and experience can make it "
"harder for them to succeed once they are in."
msgstr ""

